OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fthis morning, occasionally heavy, with
OL,7,Fmist and low cloud around North Sea
OL,8,Fcoasts. Becoming dry with bright and
OL,9,Fsunny spells this afternoon, feeling
OL,10,Fwarm or very warm in any sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry with the cloud
OL,13,Fwell broken at times. However, patchy
OL,14,Frain is possible, the rain mainly
OL,15,Fthrough Moray and western
OL,16,FAberdeenshire. Breezy and very mild.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FCloudy or bright with
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain at times. The odd
OL,20,Fheavier burst possible and winds
OL,21,Fmostly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
